&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The root cause of the failure is&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1903&quot; title=&quot;Cache configuration is serialized to nodes whether they require it or not&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1903&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-1903&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; . At first glance, it can be easily fixed.&lt;br/&gt;
I think that cache configuration initialization should be done before it is split by &lt;tt&gt;CacheConfigurationSplitter&lt;/tt&gt; - &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheProcessor.prepareCacheChangeRequest()&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
